WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:01.662
Day 10. The Final Check.

2
00:00:02.112 --> 00:00:06.970
Day ten is the final check. Your child uses their page. You mark yours.

3
00:00:07.420 --> 00:00:13.095
Do not help. None of these groups or sums is in the book before today, so memory cannot help.

4
00:00:13.695 --> 00:00:20.418
Part A: count two groups. Part B: which is more. Part C: four sums. Part D: one story sum.

5
00:00:21.018 --> 00:00:26.268
Then read the yellow box on your page, from the top, and stop at the first line that fits.

6
00:00:26.868 --> 00:00:33.019
Put this page beside the day one page. Show your child the two pages. That is the proof, on paper.

7
00:00:33.619 --> 00:00:39.343
Scan the code on your page to see the report. It shows where your child started and what comes next.

8
00:00:39.943 --> 00:00:44.142
What comes next is taking away. The One Sheet for Math starts right there.
